#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:16
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "General"
msgstr "Général"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:21
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Configure the EU-compliant order withdrawal button (Directive (EU) "
"2023/2673). Customers use the withdrawal form page to withdraw from a "
"contract; requests appear under the Requests tab."
msgstr ""
"Configurez le bouton de rétractation de commande conforme à l'UE (directive "
"(UE) 2023/2673). Les clients utilisent la page du formulaire de rétractation "
"pour se rétracter d'un contrat ; les demandes apparaissent dans l'onglet "
"Demandes."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:41
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Withdrawal page"
msgstr "Page de rétractation"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:45
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "This page should contain your withdrawal form shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Cette page doit contenir le shortcode de votre formulaire de rétractation."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:56
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Embed in footer"
msgstr "Intégrer dans le pied de page"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:57
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Embed the withdrawal button directly in the footer. Disable this option if "
"you plan to embed the page manually."
msgstr ""
"Intègre le bouton de rétractation directement dans le pied de page. "
"Désactivez cette option si vous prévoyez d'intégrer la page manuellement."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:65
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Display everywhere"
msgstr "Afficher partout"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:66
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Display the button on every page, not just on shop-related pages."
msgstr ""
"Affiche le bouton sur toutes les pages, pas seulement sur les pages liées à "
"la boutique."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:77
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Texte du bouton"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:78
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Text of the withdrawal button in the footer and header menu, and of the "
"[eggl_wd_order_withdrawal_button] shortcode. Leave empty to use \"Withdraw "
"from contract\" in each visitor's language. The Directive asks for wording "
"such as \"withdraw from contract here\" or an equally unambiguous phrase."
msgstr ""
"Texte du bouton de rétractation dans le pied de page et dans le menu d’en-"
"tête, ainsi que du shortcode [eggl_wd_order_withdrawal_button]. Laissez vide "
"pour utiliser « Se rétracter du contrat » dans la langue de chaque visiteur. "
"La directive exige une formulation telle que « se rétracter du contrat ici » "
"ou une formule tout aussi dépourvue d’ambiguïté."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:87
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Header menu"
msgstr "Menu d'en-tête"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:88
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Added to the main header menu (desktop and mobile). While off, the "
"withdrawal page is also kept out of the automatic page list some themes show "
"when no menu has been set up."
msgstr ""
"Ajouté au menu principal de l'en-tête (ordinateur et mobile). Lorsque cette "
"option est désactivée, la page de rétractation est également exclue de la "
"liste automatique des pages que certains thèmes affichent lorsqu'aucun menu "
"n'a été configuré."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:88
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Show a \"Withdraw from contract\" link in the site's header menu."
msgstr ""
"Afficher un lien « Se rétracter du contrat » dans le menu d'en-tête du site."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:96
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Guest validation"
msgstr "Validation des invités"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:97
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Choose how to validate guest withdrawal requests. Spam protection via a "
"built-in honeypot field and IP limits apply."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez comment valider les demandes de rétractation des invités. Une "
"protection anti-spam via un champ piège (honeypot) intégré et des limites "
"par IP s'applique."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:97
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Please note: As to current legal interpretation a validation lock would mean "
"that a consumer who makes a typo might no longer be able to submit their "
"withdrawal within the prescribed time limit—which directly contradicts the "
"protective purpose of Section 356a of the German Civil Code (BGB). Please "
"seek legal advise before using."
msgstr ""
"Remarque : selon l'interprétation juridique actuelle, un verrouillage par "
"validation signifierait qu'un consommateur qui fait une faute de frappe "
"pourrait ne plus être en mesure de soumettre sa rétractation dans le délai "
"prescrit — ce qui contredit directement la finalité protectrice de l'article "
"356a du Code civil allemand (BGB). Veuillez demander un avis juridique avant "
"de l'utiliser."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:103
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Enforce that the order number entered exists."
msgstr "Exiger que le numéro de commande saisi existe."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:104
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Order must exist and email must match the one from the original order."
msgstr ""
"La commande doit exister et l'e-mail doit correspondre à celui de la "
"commande d'origine."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:105
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Either order number or email address must exist."
msgstr "Le numéro de commande ou l'adresse e-mail doit exister."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:106
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Do not validate"
msgstr "Ne pas valider"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:111
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Partial withdrawals"
msgstr "Rétractations partielles"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:112
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Allow customers and verified guests to select which order items to withdraw."
msgstr ""
"Permettre aux clients et aux invités vérifiés de sélectionner les articles "
"de la commande concernés par la rétractation."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:120
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Mandatory fields"
msgstr "Champs obligatoires"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:122
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Select fields that should be mandatory while submitting a new withdrawal"
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez les champs qui doivent être obligatoires lors de la soumission "
"d'une nouvelle rétractation"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:142
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Allow guests to enter additional information in a separate text field."
msgstr ""
"Permettre aux invités de saisir des informations complémentaires dans un "
"champ de texte distinct."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:150
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Non-refundable"
msgstr "Non remboursable"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:151
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Choose certain product types to exclude from being withdrawn."
msgstr "Choisissez certains types de produits à exclure de la rétractation."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:162
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Withdrawal period"
msgstr "Délai de rétractation"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:163
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Choose the number of days, starting with the orders' completed date, to "
"accept withdrawals for orders."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez le nombre de jours, à compter de la date de finalisation de la "
"commande, pendant lesquels les rétractations sont acceptées."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:164
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Jours"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:164
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the withdrawal period does not begin until the customer "
"receives the order. If necessary add a buffer period depending on your "
"shipping process. Use 0 to make withdrawals available at any time."
msgstr ""
"Gardez à l'esprit que le délai de rétractation ne commence pas avant que le "
"client ait reçu la commande. Si nécessaire, ajoutez une marge en fonction de "
"votre processus d'expédition. Utilisez 0 pour que les rétractations soient "
"possibles à tout moment."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:174
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Unverified requests"
msgstr "Demandes non vérifiées"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:175
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Do not adjust order status for unverified requests."
msgstr "Ne pas modifier l'état de la commande pour les demandes non vérifiées."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:175
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"For some requests, the email address differs from the original stored within "
"the order. Make sure these requests do not automatically set the pending "
"withdrawal order status."
msgstr ""
"Pour certaines demandes, l'adresse e-mail diffère de celle enregistrée dans "
"la commande. Veillez à ce que ces demandes ne définissent pas "
"automatiquement l'état de commande « rétractation en attente »."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:183
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Contact email"
msgstr "E-mail de contact"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:184
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Please provide an email address where customers can contact you if they have "
"any issues."
msgstr ""
"Indiquez une adresse e-mail à laquelle les clients peuvent vous contacter en "
"cas de problème."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:194
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "My account page"
msgstr "Page Mon compte"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:195
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"On the my account page, add a link to create a new withdrawal request for "
"the order in case available."
msgstr ""
"Sur la page Mon compte, ajouter un lien permettant de créer une nouvelle "
"demande de rétractation pour la commande, le cas échéant."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:195
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Shown as a \"Withdraw\" button next to \"View\" in My account → Orders, and "
"under \"Actions\" when the customer opens an order. It only appears for "
"orders that can still be withdrawn: processing or completed, within the "
"withdrawal period, with items left to withdraw, and once the withdrawal page "
"is published."
msgstr ""
"Affiché sous forme de bouton « Se rétracter » à côté de « Voir » dans Mon "
"compte → Commandes, et sous « Actions » lorsque le client ouvre une "
"commande. Il n'apparaît que pour les commandes pouvant encore faire l'objet "
"d'une rétractation : en cours ou terminées, dans le délai de rétractation, "
"avec des articles restants, et une fois la page de rétractation publiée."

